OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of fatal stab attack
OL,4,Ajailed for 24 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed a 20-year-old to
OL,7,Fdeath in a fight on a street in
OL,8,FHuddersfield has been jailed for 24
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FLuke Belbin, 25, attacked Kyrell
OL,12,FFleary-Gayle on Greenwood Street in
OL,13,FPrimrose Hill on 20 January this year,
OL,14,Fbefore he fled the scene and was picked
OL,15,Fup in a car nearby.
OL,17,FBelbin, of Mitre Street, Huddersfield,
OL,18,Fwas found guilty of manslaughter and
OL,19,Fpossession of an offensive weapon and
OL,20,Fwas sentenced at Leeds Crown Court on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
